49	/**
50	 * Implementation of {@link IndexMaintainer} for the "version" index type. Here, the keys of the index are
51	 * required to have exactly one column that is of type {@link VersionKeyExpression Version}.
52	 * If records are added to this index with a complete {@link FDBRecordVersion} associated
53	 * with it, then the given version is used. If it is associated with an incomplete <code>RecordVersion</code>,
54	 * then it will set the key in such a way that the global version is filled in when the record is committed.
55	 * If one only ever serializes records with incomplete <code>RecordVersion</code>s, then this index guarantees
56	 * that the version column is strictly monotonically increasing with time.
57	 */
